| /   '?' = unreachable, 'x' = time may be in error, '~' = time too variable.
||                                                 .- xxxx [ yyyy ] +/- zzzz
||      Reachability register (octal) -.           |  xxxx = yyyy =  zzzz = |           .- xxxx [ yyyy ] +/- zzzz
